{"meta":{"id":"generic","category":"it/syntax/typescript/function","title":"제네릭 (Generic) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"<T> 로 타입을 매개변수처럼 받아 재사용 — 제네릭 함수 · 인터페이스 · 클래스, extends 제약","tags":["typescript","f-generic"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-amber","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">제네릭 (Generic) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> &lt;T&gt; 로 타입을 매개변수처럼 받아 재사용 — 제네릭 함수 · 인터페이스 · 클래스, extends 제약</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">제네릭 (Generic)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function first&lt;T&gt;(arr: T[]): T | undefined {\r\n  return arr[0];\r\n}\r\n\r\nconst n = first([1, 2, 3]);       // T = number\r\nconst s = first&lt;string&gt;([&quot;a&quot;]);   // 직접 지정</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">타입을 <strong>매개변수처럼</strong> 받아서, 여러 타입에 같은 로직을 재사용한다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">제네릭 타입 · 인터페이스</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">interface ApiResponse&lt;T&gt; {\r\n  success: boolean;\r\n  data: T;\r\n}\r\n\r\ntype UserRes = ApiResponse&lt;User&gt;;\r\ntype ListRes = ApiResponse&lt;User[]&gt;;\r\n\r\nclass Box&lt;T&gt; {\r\n  constructor(public value: T) {}\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">제약 (extends) · keyof</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function getLength&lt;T extends { length: number }&gt;(x: T) {\r\n  return x.length;           // length 가 있는 타입만 허용\r\n}\r\ngetLength(&quot;abc&quot;);\r\ngetLength([1, 2]);\r\n// getLength(10);            // 오류\r\n\r\nfunction pick&lt;T, K extends keyof T&gt;(obj: T, key: K): T[K] {\r\n  return obj[key];\r\n}\r\npick({ id: 1, name: &quot;kim&quot; }, &quot;name&quot;);   // string</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 기본 타입 › 타입 변환 (Mapped Type), 통신 › fetch 와 응답 타입</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/function/generic","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"function","title":"함수","path":"it/syntax/typescript/function"}],"hasImage":false}